[34.655,"o","\r\n"]
[38.255,"o","No. On the vitest 5.0.3 this project installs, you don't need `extends: true`. Inline project\r\n"]
[38.505,"o","configurations inherit options from the root-level config by default, so adding it to each project\r\n"]
[38.755,"o","changes nothing.\r\n"]
[39.005,"o","\r\n"]
[39.255,"o","That's different from Vitest 3.x/4.x, where inline projects did not inherit root settings unless you\r\n"]
[39.505,"o","set `extends: true`. Config written for those versions still works on 5.x, and the flag is now just\r\n"]
[39.755,"o","redundant. If you want a project to *not* inherit root settings, you'd now opt out explicitly,\r\n"]
[40.005,"o","presumably with `extends: false`.\r\n"]
[40.255,"o","\r\n"]
[40.505,"o","I'm getting the 5.0 default change from this project's `.ludion/lessons.md` note, which says it was\r\n"]
[40.755,"o","test-verified. I haven't checked it against the installed vitest source.\r\n"]
